%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web
    participant API
    participant Execution as Experiment Execution
    participant Search
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/Outbox
    participant Redis as Redis Streams
    participant Worker
    participant Ranking

    User->>Web: Start Search
    Web->>API: Create/start Experiment
    API->>Execution: Start command
    Execution->>DB: Manifest + Job + Outbox (atomic)
    API-->>Web: 202 + IDs + QUEUED
    DB->>Redis: Outbox publisher sends SEARCH_REQUEST
    loop Bounded in-flight until stop condition
        Redis-->>Search: Consumer group delivery
        Search->>DB: Candidate + Backtest Job + Outbox
        DB->>Redis: Publish Backtest Job
        Redis-->>Worker: At-least-once delivery
        Worker->>Worker: Backtest + Evaluate
        Worker->>DB: Result + Evaluation + Outbox (atomic)
        Worker->>Redis: ACK after durable commit
        Redis-->>Ranking: CANDIDATE_EVALUATED
        Ranking->>DB: Idempotent Top-K revision
        Ranking-->>API: Progress / revision event
        API-->>Web: WebSocket update hint
    end
